<title>UK: BP drops after Kuwait says will sell 3 pct.</title>
<headline>BP drops after Kuwait says will sell 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British Petroleum Co Plc dropped in early trading on Thursday after the Kuwait Investment Office's overnight announcement that it planned to sell a three percent stake in the company.</p>
<p>After BP's ADRs dropped $3-7/8 in the New York on Wednesday, BP shares were quoted down 22p or three percent at 722-1/2p by 0704 GMT.</p>
</text>
